%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Case 1_en-GB
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en-GB
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1f2cc62c5158e634a91c223c7368a308, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 15912132608
    m_Localized: Please identify yourself
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 637923221504
    m_Localized: I'm Leon Friedrich, 34 years old, working in a LED factory. I've
      been a citizen of the Munster closed city since the beginning of the thing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 882857992192
    m_Localized: ' Life sucked all the way since then, at least now it can''t get
      worse.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 955562057728
    m_Localized: It's a strange feeling looking at all the people who still have
      close ones you know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1098436829184
    m_Localized: 'Just waiting for the looming tragedy. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1174164987904
    m_Localized: "We all got used to it.\_"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1228913238016
    m_Localized: 'Tell me your story from the beginning to the end  '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1230666457088
    m_Localized: 'You want to torture me some more? '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1637673328640
    m_Localized: I guees thats your job poor man.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1696330670080
    m_Localized: I still try to be short.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1714471034880
    m_Localized: You can imagine i dont enjoy talking about this with stranger i
      barely see through that foggy ass window.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1717444796416
    m_Localized: I came back from work like always. Living room all in a mess, chairs
      lying on the ground, water everywhere.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1773187096576
    m_Localized: I thought something happened, so I rushed to Sophie's room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1774780932096
    m_Localized: I found her on the bed with a bag on her head. When I took it off,
      I saw a strangled kid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2548583882752
    m_Localized: My kid, the only thing that made any sense for the past six years.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2561955323904
    m_Localized: '*Sight* I''m sorry, it must have been horrible. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2585309208576
    m_Localized: "No shit.\_"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2586965958656
    m_Localized: At first, old instincts made me call for help, but when I heard
      her coming into the apartment, I knew what happened.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3130774249472
    m_Localized: I just raged at everything and attacked her. The bitch was acting
      like she didn't know, hoping to pin it on me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3131088822272
    m_Localized: 'You couldn''t know it was her at the time. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136570777600
    m_Localized: 'Why would you attack her? The kid maybe still could be saved. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3137275420672
    m_Localized: 'Oh, don''t give me that fucking crap. She was dead. I didn''t need
      a doctor, even if any would arrive in the next hour.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3572254105600
    m_Localized: It was my outrage at this whole fucking world and maybe at her.
      Lamenting all the time, caring so fucking much, like the world didn't end 25
      years ago.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3575156563968
    m_Localized: The last satisfaction I could get before turning into this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15671466385408
    m_Localized: I assume you come back from work at similar time everyday.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16639788572672
    m_Localized: 'You are right to assume that. If there were no jam because of some
      other fucked up terrorism attack by this mind twisted fucks. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16641629872128
    m_Localized: That's why im standing with my point.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16642175131648
    m_Localized: Poing being who killed?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16642703613952
    m_Localized: Point being she got mind twisted and set me up. Left the apartment
      right at the time i would arrive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16644020625408
    m_Localized: It would be stupid of her to murder her own child right in the apartment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16644888846336
    m_Localized: It would be stupid to expect normal thinking from UnPerson.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16645459271680
    m_Localized: Me killing my own child right after arriving would be even stupider.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17809881948160
    m_Localized: You are so sure she is UnPerson?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17810569814016
    m_Localized: Marry was a bitch. But she wouldn't kill Sophie. No matter how world
      or I would terrorize her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 434010781114368
    m_Localized: 'You have wife, she''s also being interrogated. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 434132101357568
    m_Localized: How has your marriage been till now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 434140414468096
    m_Localized: First, I had a wife. Second what crap do you give about my marriage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 434180440711168
    m_Localized: Like I would talk with you about it anyway
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 434181216657408
    m_Localized: Try to get that stick up your ass out first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 434181757722624
    m_Localized: It's relevant to the case. I assume you want your daughter to get
      justice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 434182386868224
    m_Localized: It's not relevant to me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 434182923739136
    m_Localized: Empathy is not common these days. But don't you care about your
      own daughter?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 434184031035392
    m_Localized: I do you fuck. But the subject comes down to her own mother strangling
      her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 434184643403776
    m_Localized: That's your precious justice...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 434185180274688
    m_Localized: 'I think you forgot what consequences those who don''t cooperate
      face. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 434185750700032
    m_Localized: Its not death.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 434564588625920
    m_Localized: We will put you to use.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 434565331017728
    m_Localized: ' .   .   .'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 434566413148160
    m_Localized: It was a happy marriage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 435551709683712
    m_Localized: Slowly destroyed by everything this world has become.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 435556780597248
    m_Localized: At some point only thing connecting us was our child Sophie.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 435708626984960
    m_Localized: We hated each other.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 435710698971136
    m_Localized: I cared less and less about everything in face of hell we live in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 435712712237056
    m_Localized: She was the opposite. Trying to hide the fact of the state of the
      world.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 435714696142848
    m_Localized: By her own how would you call it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 435718424879104
    m_Localized: exemplariness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 435720031297536
    m_Localized: I didn't really realize that fully. Until now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 435722015203328
    m_Localized: When Sophie is gone and Marry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 436106762903552
    m_Localized: Your wife Marry still lives.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 436110437113856
    m_Localized: She's an UnPerson. Not Marry. Now get off me already.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
